From 8fa1cef5163160e10449bcb4a301518bbcf1b87e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Calogero Mandracchia <calogero@efebia.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:38:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] ext/channels: deliver MCP channel notifications to the
 model

Each notification becomes <channel source="<server>" key="value">content</channel>
user input on the main thread: at once when it is idle, otherwise together
with the others waiting when it is next idle. Channel servers do not start
for sub-agents and other non-root threads.
